  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:00.750" end="00:08.750" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Paranoid, paranoid, paranoid (ayy)</p>
      <p begin="00:14.600" end="00:16.710" ttm:agent="v1">Things feel out of order</p>
      <p begin="00:16.710" end="00:21.040" ttm:agent="v1">Look and look around, I'm not sure of</p>
      <p begin="00:21.040" end="00:28.000" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Pair of paranoia, no (such a-)</p>
      <p begin="00:28.000" end="00:30.640" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Feel it in my aura (woo)</p>
      <p begin="00:30.640" end="00:34.620" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Living between cameras and recorders, ah (woo)</p>
      <p begin="00:34.620" end="00:41.170" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I want peace but can't afford ya, no (such a-)</p>
      <p begin="00:41.170" end="00:44.410" ttm:agent="v1">Pobwela panyumba panga, uyenela ku nkala ndi ulemu</p>
      <p begin="00:44.410" end="00:47.530" ttm:agent="v1">Chifukwa, ine sinifuna vokamba, kamba</p>
      <p begin="00:47.530" end="00:51.220" ttm:agent="v1">Vokamba kamba vileta pa mulomo</p>
      <p begin="00:51.220" end="00:54.990" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Wotangozi, wotangozi)</p>
      <p begin="00:54.990" end="00:57.630" ttm:agent="v1">♪</p>
      <p begin="00:57.630" end="01:02.600" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">'Running, 'running, yeah (ah-ah-ah)</p>
      <p begin="01:02.600" end="01:05.110" ttm:agent="v1">♪</p>
      <p begin="01:05.110" end="01:08.340" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">'Round (ah) and 'round (ah)</p>
      <p begin="01:08.340" end="01:11.580" ttm:agent="v1">Someone's keepin' watch</p>
      <p begin="01:11.580" end="01:14.100" ttm:agent="v1">I feel them on my shoulder</p>
      <p begin="01:14.100" end="01:20.980" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Runnin', runnin', runnin', runnin' 'round (such a-)</p>
      <p begin="01:20.980" end="01:22.480" ttm:agent="v1">I can't even buy a home in private</p>
      <p begin="01:22.380" end="01:24.050" ttm:agent="v1">Home invasions got my brothers dying</p>
      <p begin="01:24.050" end="01:25.550" ttm:agent="v1">Notice every car that's drivin' by</p>
      <p begin="01:25.440" end="01:27.190" ttm:agent="v1">I think my neighbors want me dead</p>
      <p begin="01:27.190" end="01:28.690" ttm:agent="v1">I got a cannon underneath the bed</p>
      <p begin="01:28.540" end="01:30.210" ttm:agent="v1">Triple checkin' if I locked the door</p>
      <p begin="01:30.210" end="01:31.990" ttm:agent="v1">I know every creak that's in the floor</p>
      <p begin="01:31.990" end="01:33.850" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Mother****er, I'm paranoid (such a-)</p>
      <p begin="01:33.850" end="01:37.220" ttm:agent="v1">I loop around the block, eyes glued to the rearview</p>
      <p begin="01:37.220" end="01:40.320" ttm:agent="v1">Rather double back than regret hearin', &quot;Pew, pew&quot;</p>
      <p begin="01:40.320" end="01:44.040" ttm:agent="v1">Never trust a bitch, if you good, they could trap you</p>
      <p begin="01:44.040" end="01:48.080" ttm:agent="v1">So just strap it up before they **** around and strap you, bitch</p>
      <p begin="01:48.080" end="01:51.340" ttm:agent="v1">Pobwela panyumba panga, uyenela ku nkala ndi ulemu</p>
      <p begin="01:51.340" end="01:55.080" ttm:agent="v1">Chifukwa, ine sinifuna vokamba, kamba</p>
      <p begin="01:55.080" end="01:58.140" ttm:agent="v1">Vokamba kamba vileta pa mulomo</p>
      <p begin="01:58.140" end="02:01.440" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Wotangozi, wotangozi)</p>
      <p begin="02:01.440" end="02:07.390" ttm:agent="v1">Oh, oh-oh</p>
      <p begin="02:07.390" end="02:13.040" ttm:agent="v1">Oh, oh-oh</p>
      <p begin="02:13.040" end="02:15.090" ttm:agent="v1">♪</p>
      <p begin="02:15.090" end="02:18.250" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Oh, oh-oh) Someone's keeping watch ('round)</p>
      <p begin="02:18.250" end="02:21.840" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Oh, oh-oh) I feel them in my shadow (runnin', runnin', runnin', runnin' 'round)</p>
      <p begin="02:21.840" end="02:26.120" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Someone's keepin' a watch (watchin', watchin')</p>
      <p begin="02:26.120" end="02:28.130" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Such a—)</p>
      <p begin="02:28.130" end="02:36.130" ttm:agent="v1">Someone's keepin' watch</p>
      <p begin="02:36.620" end="02:43.260" ttm:agent="v1">♪</p>
      <p begin="02:43.260" end="02:47.250" ttm:agent="v1">I can feel it, I can feel it</p>
      <p begin="02:47.250" end="02:52.400" ttm:agent="v1">I can feel it, I can feel it</p>
      <p begin="02:52.400" end="02:54.750" ttm:agent="v1">♪</p>
      <p begin="02:54.750" end="02:56.250" ttm:agent="v1">Don't trust these people out here</p>
      <p begin="02:55.800" end="02:57.300" ttm:agent="v1">Please, whatever you do</p>
      <p begin="02:56.760" end="02:58.900" ttm:agent="v1">Keep to yourself, keep your business to yourself</p>
      <p begin="02:58.900" end="03:00.400" ttm:agent="v1">Don't even trust these mother****in' accountants</p>
      <p begin="03:00.390" end="03:02.960" ttm:agent="v1">'Cause they will try to get off on you, okay?</p>
      <p begin="03:02.960" end="03:04.980" ttm:agent="v1">Please, because I don't wanna have to **** nobody up</p>
      <p begin="03:04.980" end="03:06.480" ttm:agent="v1">I promise to God</p>
      <p begin="03:05.870" end="03:11.520" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Don't it seem so good? (oh-na-na, oh-na-na, ayy)</p>
      <p begin="03:11.520" end="03:14.520" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Don't it feel so good? (oh-na-na, oh-na-na, ayy)</p>
      <p begin="03:14.520" end="03:17.470" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">To love (oh-na-na, oh-na-na, ayy)</p>
      <p begin="03:17.470" end="03:18.970" ttm:agent="v1">Left shoulder, right shoulder</p>
      <p begin="03:18.860" end="03:20.540" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Left shoulder, look (oh-na-na, oh-na-na, ayy)</p>
      <p begin="03:20.540" end="03:23.160" ttm:agent="v1">Left shoulder, right shoulder</p>
      <p begin="03:23.160" end="03:24.660" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Left shoulder, look (oh-na-na, oh-na-na, ayy)</p>
      <p begin="03:23.910" end="03:26.160" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Watch your surroundings (oh-na-na, oh-na-na, ayy)</p>
      <p begin="03:26.160" end="03:29.180" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Okay, okay, okay, yeah (oh-na-na, oh-na-na, ayy)</p>
      <p begin="03:29.180" end="03:31.660" ttm:agent="v1">No cameras out, please, I wanna eat in peace</p>
      <p begin="03:31.660" end="03:34.750" ttm:agent="v1">Don't wanna take pictures with you niggas or bitches</p>
      <p begin="03:34.750" end="03:37.530" ttm:agent="v1">Know the system is shook, way before nineteen</p>
      <p begin="03:37.530" end="03:39.040" ttm:agent="v1">LA'll do that to you</p>
      <p begin="03:39.040" end="03:40.540" ttm:agent="v1">Where you from nigga, who you?</p>
      <p begin="03:40.100" end="03:43.580" ttm:agent="v1">Satellites, screenshots, paparazzi, NDAs</p>
      <p begin="03:43.580" end="03:46.240" ttm:agent="v1">Privacy? Yeah right, I got a better shot in the NBA</p>
      <p begin="03:46.240" end="03:49.290" ttm:agent="v1">Ain't no respect for nothin', voice recordin' our discussions</p>
      <p begin="03:49.290" end="03:53.730" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Her, him, they, them or anybody, I don't trust 'em at all (all)</p>
      <p begin="03:53.730" end="03:56.280" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Some pray for my fall (Lord), hearin' clicks on the calls (Lord)</p>
      <p begin="03:56.280" end="03:57.780" ttm:agent="v1">Niggas hackin' for some rough drafts</p>
      <p begin="03:57.610" end="03:59.460" ttm:agent="v1">Bitches lookin' for a buff bag</p>
      <p begin="03:59.460" end="04:00.960" ttm:agent="v1">Risk that for some jaw, nah</p>
      <p begin="04:00.850" end="04:02.350" ttm:agent="v1">You sing along, but you don't know me, nigga</p>
      <p begin="04:02.260" end="04:03.760" ttm:agent="v1">Nah, never ever, not at all</p>
      <p begin="04:03.620" end="04:05.650" ttm:agent="v1">Y'all niggas crossed the line, like **** the stop sign</p>
      <p begin="04:05.650" end="04:07.930" ttm:agent="v1">They wanna know where I close my eyes at</p>
      <p begin="04:07.930" end="04:09.430" ttm:agent="v1">I keep my eyes wide</p>
      <p begin="04:08.720" end="04:10.440" ttm:agent="v1">On God, this shit cooked, brodie</p>
      <p begin="04:10.440" end="04:12.400" ttm:agent="v1">Look brodie, handshakes got me shook, brodie</p>
      <p begin="04:12.400" end="04:15.320" ttm:agent="v1">Niggas want info 'bout me?</p>
      <p begin="04:15.320" end="04:19.600" ttm:agent="v1">♪</p>
      <p begin="04:19.600" end="04:21.510" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Read a mother****in'-) read a book on me, uh</p>
      <p begin="04:21.510" end="04:24.320" ttm:agent="v1">Leave me alone, leave me alone</p>
      <p begin="04:24.320" end="04:27.040" ttm:agent="v1">Left shoulder, right shoulder, left shoulder, look</p>
      <p begin="04:27.040" end="04:30.190" ttm:agent="v1">Left shoulder, right shoulder, left shoulder, look</p>
      <p begin="04:30.190" end="04:34.090" ttm:agent="v1">Left shoulder, right shoulder, left shoulder, look</p>
      <p begin="04:34.090" end="04:36.570" ttm:agent="v1">Leave me alone, what you want?</p>
      <p begin="04:36.570" end="04:39.650" ttm:agent="v1">Leave me alone, what you want?</p>
      <p begin="04:39.650" end="04:44.300" ttm:agent="v1">Leave me alone, ****, damn</p>
      <p begin="04:44.300" end="04:48.300" ttm:agent="v1">Paranoid</p>
